{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2023-02-17 09:25:00', 'title': 'GRABAR LAW OFFICE INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (XRAY)', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA, PENNSYLVANIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 17, 2023) - IF YOU ARE A CURRENT LONG-TERM DENTSPLY SIRONA (NASDAQ: XRAY) SHAREHOLDER WHO HAS HELD SHARES SINCE AT LEAST JUNE 9, 2021, YOU MAY BE ABLE SEEK CORPORATE REFORMS, THE RETURN OF FUNDS BACK TO THE COMPANY, AND A COURT APPROVED INCENTIVE AWARD IF APPROPRIATE.'}